  "query": "INSERT INTO checks (habit_id, value, checked_at)\r\nVALUES ($1, $2, $3)\r\n    ON CONFLICT (habit_id, ((checked_at AT TIME ZONE 'UTC')::date))\r\nDO UPDATE SET value = checks.value + EXCLUDED.value\r\nRETURNING check_id as id, habit_id, value, checked_at;\r\n",
